[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11942.15, "timestamp": "03:19:02", "text": "龙很多次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11944.79, "timestamp": "03:19:04", "text": "呃，我们没有太多关于殴打的记忆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11947.83, "timestamp": "03:19:07", "text": "服务器内部的恶龙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11949.349, "timestamp": "03:19:09", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11951.03, "timestamp": "03:19:11", "text": "但我现在还不知道该如何战胜它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11958.389, "timestamp": "03:19:18", "text": "等等，我们是不是……或者我是不是……？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11962.309, "timestamp": "03:19:22", "text": "我记得我给其中一些命名过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11966.55, "timestamp": "03:19:26", "text": "宠物。宠物链在哪里？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11977.03, "timestamp": "03:19:37", "text": "等等，我能驯服他吗？不，我有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11983.11, "timestamp": "03:19:43", "text": "那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11986.229, "timestamp": "03:19:46", "text": "我是你的主人，在另一个世界里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11989.429, "timestamp": "03:19:49", "text": "比你更像头像。我才是真正的那个人，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11991.67, "timestamp": "03:19:51", "text": "你还是认不出我。这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11994.15, "timestamp": "03:19:54", "text": "你歪着头。"}]